  "prefLabel": "Plc 402.18 Regulated place of business",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 402.18 “Regulated place of business” means any location at which a regulated profession is or will be practiced or at which activities necessary to support the practice of a regulated profession are or will be conducted.\n\nSource. #14031, eff 8-15-24",
